                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>感知到牌子只是定位信息源，介绍来自查询回复</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 368, height: 236, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 12, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>纸面距离</Text>
